--- !u!114 &3316044591206511386
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3995185287825558032}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c5444049c29349a682d3460cdbd2ac05, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Progression.TutorialService
  _completionKey: Tutorial.Completed
  _practiceShift:
    GoalRevenue: 0
    CustomerAppearanceDelay: 0.25
    AvailableRecepies: 1
  _practiceCustomerWaitDuration: 900
  _movementStep:
    _lines:
    - Use W, A, S, and D to move around.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _pickupStep:
    _lines:
    - Use LMB for your left hand or RMB for your right hand to pick up an object.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _dropStep:
    _lines:
    - Press Q to drop the left-hand item, or E to drop the right-hand item.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _throwWaiterStep:
    _lines:
    - Pick up a waiter, hold the matching mouse button to aim, then release it to
      throw.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _computerStep:
    _lines:
    - Use the computer and open each tab. I will explain them as you go.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _shiftTabStep:
    _lines:
    - The Shift tab starts shifts and shows statistics from the previous shift.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _mealsTabStep:
    _lines:
    - The Meals tab is where you select meals requested by customers.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _shopTabStep:
    _lines:
    - The Shop tab lets you unlock and manage upgrades.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _exitComputerStep:
    _lines:
    - You can exit the computer by pressing Z, Escape, or the exit button.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _startShiftStep:
    _lines:
    - Open the Shift tab and start the practice shift.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _waiterOrderStep:
    _lines:
    - A waiter will ask a customer for their order, then return and wait for you
      to provide that meal.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _giveMealStep:
    _lines:
    - Get the requested meal and give it to the waiting waiter.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _deliverStep:
    _lines:
    - The note above the waiter shows the table number. Throw the waiter to that
      table.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _successStep:
    _lines:
    - Good job! The order was delivered successfully.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _failureStep:
    _lines:
    - That delivery missed. Be more careful with the table number and your aim.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _retryStep:
    _lines:
    - If the meal is wrong or the waiter misses, the order remains active and the
      waiter will ask for the item again.
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _finishStep:
    _lines:
    - Shift statistics are shown on the Shift tab of the computer.
    - You can start the next shift from that tab. You are ready to play!
    _onStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    _onCompleted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  _onTutorialCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  _defaultMarkerOffset: {x: 0, y: 1.5, z: 0}
  _pickupMarkerOffset: {x: 0, y: 1.5, z: 0}
  _waiterMarkerOffset: {x: 0, y: 2.2, z: 0}
  _computerMarkerOffset: {x: 0, y: 1.5, z: 0}
  _tableMarkerOffset: {x: 0, y: 1.8, z: 0}
